Local synthetic settlement console — MOCK_SETTLEMENT_ONLY, in-memory.
Receipts are action snapshots; select view explicitly for a current service observation.
Acceptance means synthetic cancellation acceptance; not real refund completion.
Distribution/refund policy: UNDETERMINED — Astra/User.
Accounting/legal effects: UNDETERMINED — User/designated advisers.
